131
00:09:46,800 --> 00:09:57,520
I guess, like, you mentioned kind of that early stage and like finding product market fit, like how long it's sometimes called wandering the desert, but like how long did you wander the desert?

132
00:09:58,080 --> 00:10:06,720
Like how long until and then when you first started to see those indications because product market fit's this like it's it's a bad term because like it's terrible.

133
00:10:07,040 --> 00:10:10,640
It means different things to different people and founders can deceive themselves all the time.

134
00:10:11,360 --> 00:10:17,760
And, and, and, and, you know, even, even YC is like, I think one of the best org for defining this and communicating this.

135
00:10:18,080 --> 00:10:19,200
